{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"pass\": true,\n  \"problems\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"reason\": \"合格。M2的理由不只是说经历过以后感受更重，而是指出强求无效、安静承受也未能消除需要，因此平静并没有使需要减弱，反而让它持续存在的事实更加明确，能够解释S07-B3重新聚起的紧张。M30则把S06已经亲身经历的幸福及其正在成为过去的感觉，推进为尚未走出幸福时身体先感到失去的骤然惊悸，解释了S07-B1的主体验，也合理地解释了S07-B2的情绪转向。两条选中的文字均符合候选原话限制；S07-B4作为音乐材料身份的另一种辨认、S07-B5作为非事实性联想独立保留，均不必强行编入人物经历。没有需要另列为未解释的听感，也没有足以判不合格的理由空泛、历史依赖失效或额外人物设定问题。\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4e6ec48f-e853-4b98-bab0-9ddba9067440", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T070336092109Z", "elapsed_seconds": 253.656, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T07:07:49.757894+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "516e7d27848418f3d2d3c797be98a9f46fc762fb4b6cd8abf0d2d6bf0fa80373", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f45